From: AscilCH <178020422+AscilCH@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:20:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 13/38] Shaders: lower image_gather4_c_lz and
 image_gather4_c_lz_o (MIMG 0x4f, 0x5f)

Lower GFX10 comparison gather instructions `image_gather4_c_lz` (0x4f) and
`image_gather4_c_lz_o` (0x5f) in `Lower::image` to DXIL
`dx.op.textureGatherCmp.f32` (opcode 74):

- Bind a comparison sampler (`0x8000`) and pass the reference value from
  address slot `first - 1` (slot 0 without `_o`, slot 1 after the packed
  offset word with `_o`).
- Unpack all four comparison results from `ResRet.f32`, matching
  `image_gather4_lz`.
- Reject non-2D/2DArray/Cube dimensions, cube gathers with programmable
  offsets, and non-red comparison gathers (`dmask != 1`, since D3D12
  comparison gather only compares channel 0).

Add `emit::valu_tests::image_gather4_c_lz_and_offset_match_rdna2` testing
2D `image_gather4_c_lz` and `image_gather4_c_lz_o` (positive and negative
6-bit signed offsets) on hardware GPU + WARP + `dxil.dll`, Cube DXIL
validation, and clean rejection of unsupported forms.

Kit-Source: Marvisak/VIctory #1489 (AscilCH)
Kit-Licence: GPL-3.0
